.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-s3-delete - Cancel a storage service


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro s3 delete  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Cancel a storage service

.PP
\fBconfirm=true\fR is required. \fBimmediate=true\fR cancels now: access keys, website and custom domains stop within about a minute and every bucket and object is deleted permanently within minutes (cannot be undone; Protected Storage versions under a COMPLIANCE lock or legal hold are kept until the lock ends and stay billable). Without \fBimmediate\fR a cancellation request is filed and the service keeps running until it is processed.

.PP
API: DELETE /cloud/storage/{id} (operationId deleteStorageService, scope cloud_delete)


